      "body": "## Summary\n\nFix HunyuanImage-3 generating garbled/incorrect images due to shared MLP reading corrupted hidden states in `HunYuanSparseMoeBlock.forward()`.\n\n## Root Cause\n\nIn `HunYuanSparseMoeBlock.forward()`, the shared MLP was executed **after** `self.experts()`. On CUDA, `FusedMoE` runs in-place by default (`inplace=True`) and overwrites `hidden_states` with the expert output. This meant the shared MLP was reading the already-overwritten tensor (expert output) instead of the original input, producing incorrect results and causing the model to generate garbled images.\n\n## Fix\n\nReorder the execution in `HunYuanSparseMoeBlock.forward()`:\n1. Run `self.shared_mlp(hidden_states)` **before** `self.experts()` so it reads the original input\n2. Then run `self.experts(hidden_states, topk_output)` which overwrites hidden_states in-place\n3. Add the shared MLP output to the expert output\n\n**File changed:** `python/sglang/multimodal_gen/runtime/models/dits/hunyuan_image3.py`\n\n## Testing\n\n- Verified HunyuanImage-3 produces correct images after the fix.\n- Non-CUDA backends (where FusedMoE does not run in-place) are unaffected by this change since the reordering is semantically correct regardless.\n\nCloses #46461\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #40259109856](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40259109856)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #40259109809](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40259109809)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #40259109798](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40259109798)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
